# `skills.scaffold`

Scaffold a new skill directory from a named shape template.

**Policy** — command `[C1_WORKSPACE]`. Capability `ship.skills.write`.

## Arguments

| name | type |
|------|------|
| `name` | `string` |
| `shape` | `string` |
| `purpose` | `string` |

## Returns

`SkillScaffoldResponse` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `route` | `string` |
| `path` | `string` |

## Invoke

```
ship ops call skills.scaffold --json '{ "name": "", "shape": "", "purpose": "" }'
```

Kind: command.

## Example response

```json
{
  "route": "/skills/checkout-validator",
  "path": "/home/dev/harbor/.ship/skills/checkout-validator/SKILL.md"
}
```
